# Weekly System – Implementation Plan (Updated)

## Data Hierarchy (read-only reference)

```
curricula  (+ edit_lock_date)   ← school admin sets the lock deadline here
  └── curriculum_versions
        └── curriculum_topics
              └── curriculum_lessons     ← lesson catalogue
                    └── curriculum_lesson_plans  (+curriculum_id de-normalized)  ← per-teacher plans
```

### ✅ Resolved Design Decisions
| Question | Decision |
|---|---|
| Admin tracking baseline | Every teacher in the school (compare all teachers vs submitted plans) |
| `curriculum_id` on lesson plans | Yes — added directly to [curriculum_lesson_plans migration](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2025_05_22_025858_create_curriculum_lesson_plans_table.php) ✅ |
| Teacher curriculum visibility | Only curricula matching teacher's assigned subjects + grades (via CST/schedule) |

