## Proposed Changes

### 1 – Page Resolver

#### [MODIFY] [pageResolver.js](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/resources/js/pageResolver.js)
Add resolver entry **before** the generic fallback so all pages in the folder are found:
```js
'myclass2026/roles/school-admin/weekly_system': () =>
  import(`./Pages/myclass2026/roles/school-admin/weekly_system/${
    pageName.replace('myclass2026/roles/school-admin/weekly_system/', '')
  }.vue`),

'myclass2026/roles/teacher/weekly_system': () =>
  import(`./Pages/myclass2026/roles/teacher/weekly_system/${
    pageName.replace('myclass2026/roles/teacher/weekly_system/', '')
  }.vue`),
```

