### 2 – `edit_lock_date` — Already in Schema ✅

`edit_lock_date DATE NULL` is now in [2024_11_30_130314_create_curricula_table.php](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/database/migrations/2024_11_30_130314_create_curricula_table.php) and [Curriculum](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum) model `$fillable`/`$casts`. Run `php artisan migrate:fresh` to apply.

