#### [NEW] `app/Http/Controllers/WeeklySystem/CurriculumController.php`

Namespace: `App\Http\Controllers\WeeklySystem`

| Method | Route | Action |
|--------|-------|--------|
| [index()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#17-24) | `GET /api/curriculum` | List curricula for the school (with grade, subject, **lock date**) |
| [store()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#118-164) | `POST /api/curriculum` | Create — duplicate name check + optional `edit_lock_date` |
| [update()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#165-205) | `PUT /api/curriculum/{id}` | Update — includes setting/clearing `edit_lock_date` |
| [destroy()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#251-271) | `DELETE /api/curriculum/{id}` | Soft-delete |

Duplicate check logic:
```php
$exists = Curriculum::where('school_id', $schoolId)
    ->where('name', $request->name)
    ->whereNull('deleted_at')
    ->exists();

if ($exists) {
    return response()->json([
        'message' => 'Curriculum name already exists in your school.'
    ], 422);
}
```

#### [NEW] `app/Http/Controllers/WeeklySystem/LessonPlanController.php`

| Method | Route | Action |
|--------|-------|--------|
| [index()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#17-24) | `GET /api/lesson-plans` | List plans (filtered by curriculum, teacher) |
| [store()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#118-164) | `POST /api/lesson-plans` | Teacher creates lesson plan |
| [update()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#165-205) | `PUT /api/lesson-plans/{id}` | Teacher edits — **locked if admin set lock date or status not draft** |
| [destroy()](file:///Users/ahmedmosaad/Herd/myclass2026-main/app/Http/Controllers/Curriculum/CurriculumController.php#251-271) | `DELETE /api/lesson-plans/{id}` | Teacher deletes — **locked if admin set lock date or status not draft** |
| `progress()` | `GET /api/lesson-plans/progress` | **New:** Admin tracking to see which teachers submitted plans |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Lock Rules — two checks, both must pass to allow editing:**
>
> **1. Status lock:** plan must be `status = 0` (draft)
>
> **2. Date lock:** curriculum's `edit_lock_date` must be `null` OR in the future
>
> Simplified backend helper (uses direct `curriculum_id`):
> ```php
> private function isLocked(CurriculumLessonPlan $plan): bool {
>     if ($plan->status !== 0) return true;
>     $curriculum = Curriculum::find($plan->curriculum_id); // Fast — no deep chain
>     return $curriculum?->edit_lock_date && now()->startOfDay()->gte($curriculum->edit_lock_date);
> }
> ```
> Returns `403`: `"Editing is closed for this curriculum."`

