### 5 – Frontend: `WeeklySystemLayout.vue` (Shared, Role-Aware)

A wrapper component every sub-page uses with **role-aware navigation**:
- Reads `$page.props.auth.user.roles` to determine which tabs to show:

**Admin sees:**
| Tab | URL |
|-----|-----|
| 🏠 Home | `/weekly-system` |
| 📚 Curriculum & Locks | `/weekly-system/curriculum-lessons` |
| 📋 Weekly Plans | `/weekly-system/weekly-plans-manager` |

**Teacher sees:**
| Tab | URL |
|-----|-----|
| 📚 My Lesson Plans | `/weekly-system/teacher-curriculum-lessons` |
| 📋 My Weekly Plans | `/weekly-system/my-weekly-plans` |

