# List new routes
php artisan route:list --name=weekly-system.curriculum
php artisan route:list --name=weekly-system.api
```

### Manual Browser Tests
1. Navigate to `/weekly-system` → see tile menu + top nav tab bar
2. Click "Curriculum & Plans" tile → navigate to `/weekly-system/curriculum-lessons`
3. Top nav tab bar still visible
4. Create a curriculum → appears in the table
5. Try same name again → red inline banner appears (no page reload)
6. Click on curriculum row → Section B slides in showing lesson plans
7. Add a lesson plan → appears in the table
